<item name='HFText'><text>No</text></item>
<item name='HelpECategories'><text>2. Database Custodian Guide</text></item>
<item name='HelpESubCat'><text>Customizing the Application</text></item>
<item name='HelpFCategories'><text>2. Guide de gardien de base de données</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubCat'><text>Customizing the Application</text></item>
<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>2</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>2</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='73%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>When a staff member is ordering from a Company that is not in the Order Tracking database, they are asked if the Company should be added to the database.  If they say yes, they fill in a small form that is then emailed to the Admin person to be added to the database.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>To add the new company to the database:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.  From the Admin area select Companies from the navigator.</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1.2500in'/>
